#. de: Splitter[p] des Ifrit-Zaubersteins
#. fr: magilithe d'Ifrit
#. column 3: splinters of Inferno magicite
#. column 9: Inferno Magicite
#. column 10: Creates a simulacrum of Ifrit, Lord of the Inferno, based off the wielder's memories of past encounters with the primal.
msgctxt "DeepDungeonMagicStone:1:0:1"
msgid "splinter of Inferno magicite"
msgstr "осколок магического камня Ифрита"

